NV_PK(14,{"the lake is in yuchi township nantou county the only landlocked county in taiwan the central mountain range is to the east and the shuishe massif is to the west":"","national scenic area":"","the sun moon lake national scenic area was set up in 2000 and covers about 9 000 hectares":"","getting there":"","nantou has no railway station guests come by nantou bus 6670 from taichung hsr about 50 minutes or by the taiwan tourist shuttle from taichung station from taipei it is about 3 hours":"","through the year":"","cherry blossom in february and march rain from may to september the swimming carnival in mid september and clear air with morning mist from october to march the average temperature is about 21 degrees":"","mist is part of the show":""});